      "content": "i mean, you actually said it. you basically agreed with me. it's weird how much relief i feel hearing that from you, because it's the only thing that's felt true in weeks. everything else is just people telling me what i \"should\" feel. but if it's true... if it really would be better... then why am i still fighting it?",
